#: admin/components/general-settings.js:161
msgid ""
"Remember a guest currency in a cookie and matching browser-storage fallback. "
"Disable this and logged-out visitors cannot keep a currency choice at all — "
"the switch is reported as failed rather than silently ignored."
msgstr ""
"Die Währung eines Gastes in einem Cookie und ersatzweise im passenden "
"Browser-Speicher merken. Wenn Sie dies deaktivieren, können abgemeldete "
